      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$f(-3)= 5 +5; f(-3)= 5 +5;$$ $$f(2)=5; f(2)=5;$$ $$f(-a)= 2+a +5; f(-a)= 2+a +5;$$ $$-f(a)=- 2-a -5;-f(a)=- 2-a -5;$$ $$f(a+h)= 2-a-h +5 f(a+h)= 2-a-h +5$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
