      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$f(-3)=2;f(-3)=2;$$ $$f(2)=1-3=-2; f(2)=1-3=-2;$$ $$f(-a)=| -a-1 |-| -a+1 |; f(-a)=|-a-1|-|-a+1|;$$ $$-f(a)=-| a-1 |+| a+1 |;-f(a)=-|a-1|+|a+1|;$$ $$f(a+h)=| a+h-1 |-| a+h+1 | f(a+h)=|a+h-1|-|a+h+1|$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
